    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.test\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4452431-56ef-484b-99d7-6d957e82bbc3\r\n\r\nLeaving mini.test floating window removes the background but not the text, and does not close the window.\r\n\r\n### Neovim version\r\n\r\n0.10.1\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- mini.test version 0.13.0\r\n- `MiniTest.run`\r\n- Leave the mini test window\r\n\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nThe window closes\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\nThe window remains open, but the background disappears",
