            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nHow do you do the \"Leave the mini test window\" step? If it is a `<C-w>p` or `<C-w>w` (or similar), then it is expected as the window is not closed with that. To close the window, press [`<Esc>` or `q`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e50cf9de614500a20e47cfc50e30a100042f91c3/doc/mini-test.txt#L621-L623).\r\n\r\nI'd guess that it appears that \"... window removes the background but not the text\" due to color scheme.",
