        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yeah, with `<C-w>w`. I'm actually using [alexghergh/nvim-tmux-navigation](https://github.com/alexghergh/nvim-tmux-navigation) but I guess it amounts to the same thing.\r\n\r\nI didn't realise this was intended. A lot of the plugins I use close popups if they lose focus. What's the use case for them staying open?",
